nc_oc=AdrkN8DVuKq28xqQpo1UuPlYBD4FTgDgqVfQ4Xvyn_r0dyJlhYnN-wbbvOMQIDZTDGRzILSMtGlHGMFCCzVgOMj6&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna&_nc_gid=9GC3RfVDb5dm3pgAZGfU7g&_nc_ss=70689&oh=00_AQSzQnlYhsQsn99PSoOSgxErqsUz3SON1rVAupXVQzG7rA&oe=6AF814DE", "width": 1080, "height": 1920, "id": "12", "resolution": "1080x1920"}], "comments": [{"author": "zeno_.x3", "author_id": "55126589456", "id": "18220631683359874", "text": "Bhawan Ganesh hi🛐🕉️", "timestamp": 1794247880, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "kushshh._", "author_id": "48874845574", "id": "17882996202543579", "text": "🙌", "timestamp": 1794210374, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "the_unwanted_thorn_in_rose", "author_id": "74913395643", "id": "18104254694537407", "text": "Lakshman", "timestamp": 1794079863, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "nickkillsmen", "author_id": "916848342", "id": "18108165308199108", "text": "Yet, he ordered his wife to be strucked down so easily. 🥴😒", "timestamp": 1793950268, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "sam.winchester.goat", "author_id": "78046916145", "id": "18640208536059278", "text": "2 men 1020 arms 😭", "timestamp": 1793890369, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "_.itskinggpinn._", "author_id": "28615714004", "id": "18132501478749955", "text": "Wasn't it Lord Shiva (since Lord Parashuram considered Shiva as his master)once and once Lord Rama (years before Maharabharat happened). Correct me if I'm wrong, as I don't wanna be having wrong concept in mythology.", "timestamp": 1793704377, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "writer_vighnesh_19", "author_id": "47422857643", "id": "17916578553530515", "text": "Lord Parshurama, however, is humbled several times. 1st Lord Ganesha as per Ganesha Purana, 2nd Lord Shiva as per Shiva Purana, 3rd Lord Dattatreya as per Skanda, 4th Lord Rama as per the Ramayana, and 5th Lord Krishna as per Hari Katha", "timestamp": 1793672417, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "writer_vighnesh_19", "author_id": "47422857643", "id": "18136744699736371", "text": "Irony is that both Lord Parshurama and Kartyaveera Arjuna were the disciples of Guru Dattatreya but Parshurama controlled his desires where Kartyaveera Arjuna was stuck inside them. This is where he got humbled through his final achievement, i.e., death by the hands of Lord Parshurama", "timestamp": 1793672238, "like_count": 6}, {"author": "phantomzero.art", "author_id": "39438483891", "id": "17968137693219729", "text": "Parshurama never ducks a fade fr 😭😭😭", "timestamp": 1793665879, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "astroscopus96", "author_id": "65389623244", "id": "18128877538882371", "text": "So let me get this straight, he says to his son to forgive as that is what a brahmin should do, fair enough, but why didn’t he use the same logic and forgive his wife, also why did he ask his sons to kill his wife, why didnt he do it himself", "timestamp": 1793636854, "like_count": 0}, {"author": "ritwik_chaitanya", "author_id": "2269237526", "id": "18100239629078053", "text": "Parashurama was humbled by Ram", "timestamp": 1793630271, "like_count": 83}, {"author": "ay_vamsikrishna.7.369", "author_id": "58572322756", "id": "18006963159007100", "text": "Last one is demeaning lord Vishnu.", "timestamp": 1793620898, "like_count": 0}], "webpage_url": "https://www.instagram.com/p/DfOr9i3xkrb/", "webpage_url_basename": "DfOr9i3xkrb", "webpage_url_domain": "instagram.com", "extractor": "Instagram", "extractor_key": "Instagram", "thumbnail": "https://instagram.fblr22-1.fna.fbcdn.net/v/t51.82787-15/877746872_18131377978755882_4388001362633680422_n.jpg?stp=dst-jpg_e15_tt6&_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ig_cache_key=NDAyMTM0NDg2MjYxOTQ1NDE3MQ%3D%3D.3-ccb7-5&ccb=7-5&_nc_sid=58cdad&efg=eyJ2ZW5jb2RlX3RhZyI6IkNMSVBTLnhwaWRzLjEwODAuc2RyLnZpZGVvX2RlZmF1bHRfY292ZXJfZnJhbWUuQzMifQ%3D%3D&_nc_ohc=3Gd4wgdpLkUQ7kNvwEtOkRq&_nc_oc=AdrkN8DVuKq28xqQpo1UuPlYBD4FTgDgqVfQ4Xvyn_r0dyJlhYnN-wbbvOMQIDZTDGRzILSMtGlHGMFCCzVgOMj6&_nc_zt=23&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr22-1.fna&_nc_gid=9GC3RfVDb5dm3pgAZGfU7g&_nc_ss=70689&oh=00_AQSzQnlYhsQsn99PSoOSgxErqs